  "hero_summary_zh": "帕吉每次精准地甩出标志性的长钩时都将恐惧深深印入敌人心中。他将敌人拉到身边，用屠刀大卸八块，而自己从阵亡的敌人身上获得了额外的力量和攻击力，不遑多时就会成为势不可挡的杀手。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Each carefully aimed throw of Pudge's signature hook strikes fear into his foes. Pulling his enemies near to carve them with his cleavers, he gains additional health and damage with every kill, and soon becomes an unstoppable killer.",
